# Book Rag

A local LLM that answers questions about the lore of my novel series — powered by [Ollama](https://ollama.com), grounded in my Obsidian worldbuilding vault, and running entirely on my own machine.

## Overview

Loremaster turns years of scattered worldbuilding notes into something you can *ask*. It reads the markdown notes from an Obsidian vault, indexes them, and uses a locally-hosted language model (via Ollama) to answer questions about characters, places, timelines, and history — with the answers grounded in the actual source notes rather than made up.

Because everything runs locally through Ollama, no notes or queries ever leave the machine, and there are no API costs.

<!-- TODO: adjust the paragraph above if your approach is fine-tuning rather than
