## Features

- Answers natural-language questions about the series' lore
- Grounds every answer in the actual Obsidian notes (retrieval, not hallucination)
- Runs fully offline via Ollama — no external APIs, no data leaving the machine
- Point it at any Obsidian vault (or folder of markdown) and re-index

## Requirements

- Python 3.11+
- [Ollama](https://ollama.com) installed and running locally
- A pulled model — e.g. `ollama pull llama3.1` <!-- TODO: your actual model -->
- An Obsidian vault (or any folder of `.md` notes) as the lore source
- Dependencies listed in `requirements.txt`

