## Usage

First, index your vault (run once, and again whenever notes change):

```bash
python index.py               # TODO: your real command
```

Then ask it things:

```bash
python ask.py "Who rules the northern kingdom and how did they come to power?"
```

Or interactively:

```bash
python ask.py
> What's the relationship between <Character A> and <Character B>?
```

